cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GEOloopOS in research, an article, or a report, please cite it as below."
title: "GEOloopOS — GEO 优化操作系统 / AI Identity Engine"
abstract: >-
  GEOloopOS is an open-source tool that measures how well AI search engines
  and LLMs (DeepSeek, Doubao, and others) recognize, describe, and recommend a
  brand, a person, or a website — then turns that visibility into a trackable,
  growable digital identity asset. It is the identity engine behind the
  "Generative Engine Optimization" (GEO) practice.
authors:
